[[7,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Disconnect the battery negative\nterminal.</p><p><a href=\"#/2752991\">5550D16</a></p><p>1. Disengage the clip (1a) and remove the bulb holder (1b).</p><p>2. Remove the bulb concerned.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2046982.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[7,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the bulb in the bulb holder.</p><p>Fit the bulb holder and check that it is\nsecure.</p><p><a href=\"#/2752991\">5550D16</a></p><p>Disconnect the battery negative terminal.</p>"]]